#: patterns/how-to-prepare-timeline.php:9
msgid "Define the goal"
msgstr "Define the goal"

#: patterns/how-to-prepare-timeline.php:10
msgid ""
"Before anything else: what should the site actually do? Sell a product, book"
" appointments, publish articles, replace a broken WordPress install. One "
"sentence is enough to start."
msgstr ""
"Before anything else: what should the site actually do? Sell a product, book"
" appointments, publish articles, replace a broken WordPress install. One "
"sentence is enough to start."

#: patterns/how-to-prepare-timeline.php:11
msgid "You bring: the goal, the deadline, the budget range"
msgstr "You bring: the goal, the deadline, the budget range"

#: patterns/how-to-prepare-timeline.php:14
msgid "Gather your materials"
msgstr "Gather your materials"

#: patterns/how-to-prepare-timeline.php:15
msgid ""
"The single biggest cause of delay is missing content. Collect logo files, "
"brand colours and fonts, photos, product data, legal pages and the text for "
"each page — or tell me you need help writing it."
msgstr ""
"The single biggest cause of delay is missing content. Collect logo files, "
"brand colours and fonts, photos, product data, legal pages and the text for "
"each page — or tell me you need help writing it."

#: patterns/how-to-prepare-timeline.php:16
msgid "You bring: logo, copy, images, 2–3 reference sites"
msgstr "You bring: logo, copy, images, 2–3 reference sites"

#: patterns/how-to-prepare-timeline.php:19
msgid "Contact me or book a call"
msgstr "Contact me or book a call"

#: patterns/how-to-prepare-timeline.php:20
msgid ""
"Send the brief by email or book a 20-minute call. I reply within a day with "
"first questions and a rough feasibility answer — including an honest “this "
"isn’t for me” when that’s the case."
msgstr ""
"Send the brief by email or book a 20-minute call. I reply within a day with "
"first questions and a rough feasibility answer — including an honest “this "
"isn’t for me” when that’s the case."

#: patterns/how-to-prepare-timeline.php:21
msgid "I deliver: reply in 24 h, first questions"
msgstr "I deliver: reply in 24 h, first questions"

#: patterns/how-to-prepare-timeline.php:24
msgid "Discuss ideas and agree the scope"
msgstr "Discuss ideas and agree the scope"

#: patterns/how-to-prepare-timeline.php:25
msgid ""
"We turn the brief into a written scope: page list, features, integrations, "
"who writes the content, what is explicitly out of scope. You get a fixed "
"quote or an hourly estimate with a cap, plus a timeline and payment "
"schedule."
msgstr ""
"We turn the brief into a written scope: page list, features, integrations, "
"who writes the content, what is explicitly out of scope. You get a fixed "
"quote or an hourly estimate with a cap, plus a timeline and payment "
"schedule."

#: patterns/how-to-prepare-timeline.php:26
msgid "I deliver: written scope, quote, timeline"
msgstr "I deliver: written scope, quote, timeline"

#: patterns/how-to-prepare-timeline.php:29
msgid "Pick a direction — templates and design"
msgstr "Pick a direction — templates and design"

#: patterns/how-to-prepare-timeline.php:30
msgid ""
"You review layout templates and a design direction: typography, colour, "
"section styles, and how it behaves on mobile. Choosing from a system is "
"faster and cheaper than a blank-page design, and you can still customise "
"every section."
msgstr ""
"You review layout templates and a design direction: typography, colour, "
"section styles, and how it behaves on mobile. Choosing from a system is "
"faster and cheaper than a blank-page design, and you can still customise "
"every section."

#: patterns/how-to-prepare-timeline.php:31
msgid "You bring: one round of consolidated feedback"
msgstr "You bring: one round of consolidated feedback"

#: patterns/how-to-prepare-timeline.php:34
msgid "Access and setup"
msgstr "Access and setup"

#: patterns/how-to-prepare-timeline.php:35
msgid ""
"Hosting, domain and DNS, repository, CMS accounts, analytics, payment or "
"mailing providers. Send credentials through a password manager, never by "
"email — and give me a staging environment rather than the live site."
msgstr ""
"Hosting, domain and DNS, repository, CMS accounts, analytics, payment or "
"mailing providers. Send credentials through a password manager, never by "
"email — and give me a staging environment rather than the live site."

#: patterns/how-to-prepare-timeline.php:36
msgid "You bring: hosting, domain, CMS and analytics access"
msgstr "You bring: hosting, domain, CMS and analytics access"

#: patterns/how-to-prepare-timeline.php:39
msgid "Build, with a demo you can watch"
msgstr "Build, with a demo you can watch"

#: patterns/how-to-prepare-timeline.php:40
msgid ""
"Development happens on a staging URL you can open any time. You get a short "
"written update at each milestone, so nothing arrives as a surprise at the "
"end."
msgstr ""
"Development happens on a staging URL you can open any time. You get a short "
"written update at each milestone, so nothing arrives as a surprise at the "
"end."

#: patterns/how-to-prepare-timeline.php:41
msgid "I deliver: staging link, milestone updates"
msgstr "I deliver: staging link, milestone updates"

#: patterns/how-to-prepare-timeline.php:44
msgid "Testing and the fix round"
msgstr "Testing and the fix round"

#: patterns/how-to-prepare-timeline.php:45
msgid ""
"Cross-browser and real-device checks, Core Web Vitals, accessibility, forms,"
" redirects and SEO metadata. You review on staging and send one consolidated"
" list; I fix and re-test until it’s signed off."
msgstr ""
"Cross-browser and real-device checks, Core Web Vitals, accessibility, forms,"
" redirects and SEO metadata. You review on staging and send one consolidated"
" list; I fix and re-test until it’s signed off."

#: patterns/how-to-prepare-timeline.php:46
msgid "I deliver: test report, fixes, re-test"
msgstr "I deliver: test report, fixes, re-test"

#: patterns/how-to-prepare-timeline.php:49
msgid "Launch, handover and aftercare"
msgstr "Launch, handover and aftercare"

#: patterns/how-to-prepare-timeline.php:50
msgid ""
"Go-live with backups and redirects in place, then you get the repository, "
"all accounts in your name, a short walkthrough of how to edit content, and "
"30 days of bug cover. Optional monthly support continues from there."
msgstr ""
"Go-live with backups and redirects in place, then you get the repository, "
"all accounts in your name, a short walkthrough of how to edit content, and "
"30 days of bug cover. Optional monthly support continues from there."

#: patterns/how-to-prepare-timeline.php:51
msgid "I deliver: launch, docs, ownership, 30-day cover"
msgstr "I deliver: launch, docs, ownership, 30-day cover"

